# #5833. Weakens the assumption on B that a bulk switch's close head is above every
# record allocated before it. Under the lazy arm a bulk-born leaf no longer replays to a
# claim head, so a record the range held before the switch, above the leaf's birth read
# position, is passed. It edits an operator, not an action.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestAssumeBulkCloseBelowPriorAllocations
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a bulk switch's close head covers only foreign records
BOUNDS: WithBulk = TRUE

--- FIND
CloseCovers == IF WithPreArm /\ WithBulk THEN {Foreign, PreAuthor} ELSE {Foreign}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the close head need cover foreign records only.
CloseCovers == {Foreign}
--- END
